A||||13||GT Bastard||Who enjoys being the underdog?||||14||
Z||000000||GT Bastard||03-11-2000||12:12 PM||||It seems that the general consensus among non-fiero-folk is that the Fiero is an underdog(at least that's what I get around here.)  Pre-88 suspension not good enough, car is too heavy, too little power, too small, and so on.... Granted, there is some truth to those things, but I actually welcome the challenge of making this "underdog" perform.  Any fool can go buy themselves a fast car, but not anybody can MAKE a car better.  And the more negative things people say about our plastic friend, the more surprised their faces will look staring at a set of Fiero tail lights.  What do YOU think? ||||reg||14
Z||000001||Shiner||03-11-2000||12:34 PM||||I love it!  I think that fiero people are really united by this too.  We all love our cars, and don't mind fighting for them.  If I was worried about what everybody thought about my car, I would have gotten a Ford, or something equally stupid  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000002||2M4 Dale||03-11-2000||02:48 PM||||DITTO||||reg||14
Z||000003||Ozzy||03-11-2000||03:13 PM||||Dude, I get so much crap about this car from my work buddies and everyone else.<P>When it comes down to it, I'm not doing this to make them happy or to gain their approval or the like. I'm doing it 'cause I like the car. No body else's opinion matters when placed in this perspective!<P>Ozzy||||reg||1
Z||000004||bHooper||03-11-2000||04:58 PM||||ozman, well said!  today i went to help my buddy repalce the brake booster on his car... were at the parts store and this customer (who can barely speak english) starts giving him the "im sorry thats your car" routine!  i stepped in and told him, they are great cars and anything can have a bad rep if the media decides they dont like it... man, that ticked me off!||||reg||1
Z||000005||87GT||03-11-2000||09:24 PM||||Somebody told me again today that Fieros blow up when there rear ended and they always have problems.  I asked, "Have you ever owned one?" the reply, "No."  I say, "Then how do you know that?"  Reply, "WEll that is what THEY said."  Who is they I ask?  I dont know was the reply.. good grief||||reg||1
Z||000006||Greg Piet||03-12-2000||05:54 AM||||I used to drive a friends 86 SE v6 and I loved it.  I bought my Fiero, because I knew I would be happy with the v6 power, and it was always picked on which just didnt seem right.  Every person who has driven in my car has told me beforehand that Fieros suck.  When they get out of the car, normally all they have to say is "Damn!" or " SH!T  I guess I was wrong".  My close budddies now defend the Fiero, and they normally tell the person who is badmouthing our plastic car that they should come see me so they can be proven wrong.  I would love to get the safety report where the Fiero lost only to the volvo in overall safety.  That would be the icing on the cake.||||reg||1
Z||000007||GT Bastard||03-12-2000||02:00 PM||||My dad for instance..... He's a die-hard Chevy V8 fan, but the Fiero has softened him a bit.  When I first mentioned that I wanted a Fiero he said "yeah, those are cute."  Now he's actually considering selling his C4 Vette in favor of a nice GT.  Same with a friend of mine.... Nothing but F-bodies.  It took some effort on my part, but he FINALLY respects the Fiero.||||reg||14
Z||000008||sully5||03-12-2000||03:01 PM||||Just shows how ignorant some people can be. Seems that there has always been a Fiero in the family. My uncle had a new one in 84. Mom bought a used one in 90, then gave it to my brother. It got totaled in 93 (not his fault, guy turned left into the front fender). Then came the SE I just got. How many cars can go through a college kid using it as transportation, rack up 141,000 miles, and still run strong - with little or no tlc? Only prob with the motor is it smokes on start up, valve seals I'm thinkin. They are definitely a great little car. And I have to say, not all Fords are bad. I've got a 1996 F250 4x4 extra cab XLT I am driving every day now. Love it as much as the little car. Wouldn't get rid of either one.||||reg||1
Z||000009||DJRice||03-13-2000||09:37 AM||||Well I've been a Miami Dolphin fan for years, so I guess that means that I dont mind being an underdog either.||||reg||1
Z||000010||sinoloa||03-13-2000||04:19 PM||||How many people break their necks looking at a Grand-Am or a Ford Taurus going down the road? My Fiero has broken down on me several times, but I still love the car and its never had a problem that wasn't easily fixed. I love the underdog and I'm proud to own a car that stands out on the highway and isn't as generic as the cars most people drive.  This car is worth working on because I never get bored looking at it, or being looked at by admiring passers - by.||||reg||1
Z||000011||Robert||03-13-2000||10:29 PM||||You should see the mouths drop open when people find out my 87GT is a Fiero.  The most often comment is “I’ve never seen a Fiero that looks like yours”.  Most of the Fieros I see around my town are not well maintained.  <P>You know you are a Fieroholic every time you can’t help but look back at your car after walking away from it.<BR> <BR><p>[This message has been edited by Robert (edited 03-13-2000).]||||reg||6
Z||000012||BAM-BAM||03-13-2000||11:31 PM||||  Yo, All you Fi-Dogs, check out my post. I almost fell victim to the lies; now I'm a believer.  Props out to all, theres none betta, Belei-dat! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><BR> <BR> Check, I'm out!<BR> BAM <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||12
Z||000013||Dan86gt3.8||03-14-2000||01:53 AM||||HELL YES I love it!!!!!  how can anyone say that thees cars are unsafe, or blow up on impact?  And as far as anyone dissing the handling, I have never driven a better handling car!!!!  I want someone to tell me the handlling sucks when I take a 90 degree left hander that slopes down hill at 50 without screeching the tires on a stock suspension! lord only knows what it would do with springs, shocks,sway bars, and poly all the way around!  Also, you do not hear anyone quote the excellent crash test results instead of if you hit a car at more than 5 mph your car will blow up upon impact and eveyone in a one mile radius will die.  I also love spanking rednecks in their trucks, or stupid ricers, and even some stang/f-body guys!  I love it when they catch back up to me and say "what the f--- do you have in thier?"  I can't wait to make it even faster!!!!  I gues I have ranted enough, my only complaint, not tons of space, but then again how many mid-eninge 2 seaters do?||||reg||1
